comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T04:32:07.191Z",codex-agent,"Companion specification pm-cli-website-iwyd read without modification. Scope: first-slice exact observations and conversions, semantic comparisons, bounded binary derivations for acceptance evidence, native CAS/replay, production gates. Reviewed declaration changes and general expression algebra remain explicit follow-ups."
  "2026-11-06T06:07:34.306Z",codex-agent,"Implementation is local on feat/unit; companion pm-cli-website-iwyd was read only. Final public proof: 53 quantities, 47/47 exact claims, 6 non-comparable diagnostics, 2 unsafe sums refused, and 1 disclosed unknown derivation. Complete ten-claim packet: 12516 bytes, 3129 tokens, versus 72659 raw-item tokens; evaluator 173 explicit calls and 16427 ms. No release-ready arbitrary-provider or native producer-cursor parity claim: see the open package blocker Features. All work claims will be released and items remain unclosed for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-11-06T07:10:13.717Z",claude-orchestrator,"Orchestrator review before the public repo: applied the scaffold fixes from pm-glossary#5. The maintainer squash-merge author is approved, as in pm-http and pm-glossary. The sync-caller test reads only active lines and requires one full-SHA pin with a version comment. The deprecated pm-github-version input is removed, so Dependabot SHA bumps pass. workflow.test 3/3; identity:check zero violations."
